window.products.push({"id":1109111,"name":"Faux Flower Arrangement in Vase - Life Like Silk Flower Bouquet Set in Glass Square Vase - Faux Flower Set Ideal for Wedding, Party, Décor – Soft Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ag24gXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>We prioritize passion and hard work above all else. That is why we are committed to developing improved, real-touch feel products. We are taking our inspirations from nature and bring into your houses top quality faux flowers. If for some reason you are not pleased with your purchase, feel free to contact us, and our customer care departments has got you covered.  Why is this product for you? Our amazing Faux Flower Arrangement should not be mission from your house or your garden. And even if we talk about a wedding, a birthday party or just a fancy dinner, this Flower Bouquet in a wood square planter is the ideal gift or a special Décor. Coming in three colors combination, they are perfect for every environment.  Some of the amazing features of this product: Rich bouquet that blends in every environment. Classy glass square planter that offers both a vintage and a modern look. Made with top quality materials to last longer than your normal flowers. With a length of 4 x 4 x 7 inches is suitable for any surface. A flower arrangement offering a unique silk touch feel. Comes in a variety of colors matching every décor.  To be shared with family and friends.   Even if they feel like real flowers, they don’t need to be taken care of.  The perfect dinner or weeding table center piece.   Easy to clean and wash.   Offering flowers is now easier with our premium faux flowers arrangement.</p> ✅ Vibrant Color: The peony flowers arranged in the vase has a lovely pink color that makes them elegant. The color leaves you with multiple options of how you can use these flowers. Also, the color gives the flower a vibrant look and makes it more life-like. ✅ Adjustable Stems: The stems of the flowers are made up of metal wire and then wrapped from plastic. The metal wire lets the stem to bend in whatever shape or arrangement we want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-ag24gXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08P25NGKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P25NGKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P25NGKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109112,"name":"PASSENGER PIGEON Blackout Window Shades, Navy Blue Custom Thermal Insulated Waterproof Fabric Roller Blinds, Metal Chain Sun Roller Shades for Windows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g6eqQf2mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 2inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount. INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Solid color roller shade. Feature: Thermal Blackout Waterproof Material: Polyester Fabric Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g6eqQf2mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B08HZ5VKK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HZ5VKK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HZ5VKK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
