window.products.push({"id":1109122,"name":"Salt and Pepper Grinders-Set of 3 Refillable ARNLNGD Himalayan Sea Salt Grinder with Anti-Slip Glass, Salt and Pepper Mill Grinder, Peppercorn Mill - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bP4D7TjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【A Feast for The Eyes and Palate】 - Attractive design of the salt and pepper grinder set, a mix of classic and modern,non-slip glass lead/cadmium free, with larger / stylish / \"sexy\" fluted clear grinding bottle, thick and easy to grip.The shape is very comfortable to grip and the hand will not slip off while cooking.The shakers look great in the kitchen as well as on the dining table. so they match any table decoration. 【Environmentally Friendly Ceramic Grinding Cores】- Adjustable coarseness, so you can choose the degree of grinding you want. The grinding core of the salt mill is matched with super large ceramic rotors. Adjustment is as simple as turning the top small dial, rough / medium / fine. Older / children can be easily twisted, the whole thing is strong and comfortable. Just a few effortless twists to add fresh sea salt, pepper, cumin, cloves or other spices. 【Top Grinder, Stainless Steel Dust Cover】- ARNLNGD salt and pepper grinder with sealed metal cap prevents salt from hardening due to moisture and keeps spices fresh and long-lasting.you can grind pepper salt in the cap. Make sure the salt and pepper are only on your food and do not \"leak\" onto your table. Perfect! 【Easy to Use】- ARNLNGD salt and pepper mill is detachable, the grinder is easy to unscrew and clean. No battery is needed and thanks to the glass container, you can always see how much spice is left in the container. Grinders save a lot of money over time. 【Look Forward to Hearing from You】- ARNLNGD salt grinder set is rigorously tested and inspected to ensure quality, durability and longevity, certified by ((EC) No 1935/2004 and CM/Res(2013) 9- Heavy Metals Specific Migration)，If you have any questions about this grinder, please feel free to contact us, we will definitely provide you with a satisfactory solution. We are committed to providing you with a pleasant buying and user experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bP4D7TjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARNLNGD","source_asin":"B09K3DJ28V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K3DJ28V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K3DJ28V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
