window.products.push({"id":1109283,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Whole House, 8L 2.1Gal 36dB Quiet Ultrasonic Humidifier Cool Mist Humidifiers for Baby Kids Nursery Plants, Customi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qwRRnH5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【BEDROOM MUST HAVES】A good humidifier for bedroom creates a comforting indoor condensation level that can soothe your cracked skin and help you breathe more easily. The KONSIDEN ultrasonic humidifier does everything right because it’s quieter, more durable, and easier to deal with overall than any other air humidifier. It’s easy to clean, and it humidifies the air quickly and almost silently. 【UPGRADE TOP FILL HUMIDIFIERS - 8L Large Tank】 Refilling has never been easier due to the top-fill design! Simply pour water into the small insert at the top of the unit. The 10L humidifier for large room makes it fill less often than other humidifiers, and the large humidifier humidifies up to 800ft² rooms, perfect for office bedroom baby, nursery, plants, pets. With wide opening water tank, provides easy access to clean the empty tank thoroughly with a wet cloth. 【MULTIPLE MIST SETTINGS + 360°ROTATING NOZZLE】Designed with a super simple control dial so that you can fully control the mist flow direction. Other humidifiers may make wet floors and soggy furniture. Thanks to advanced customized humidity and 12 Hours timer settings function, our KONSIDEN cool mist humidifiers feature 3-Mist Speeds and also can achieve a target humidity level and maintain it on an “auto” setting that actually works(Adjust the optimal humidity level between 40% to 90%RH). 【Easy Operate & Enjoy Life】The Modern Tower design frees up your desktop by placing your humidifier directly on the ground! You can operate the humidifiers by the simple digital display or operate it with the included remote control. It’s a large cool mist humidifier that has been engineered for quiet operation. Even when operating at full capacity, the machine emits only 36dB of noise. There is also an option to turn the display off if you have a problem with the brightness of the screen 【Your Satisfaction Is Our Priority】 The KONSIDEN humidifiers do not require any filters. For the budget-conscious user, this is perfect as it reduces the ongoing costs of running this humidifier, perfect for office bedroom, nursery, plants, large room, and pets. We do everything in our power to ensure you receive the perfect product every time. In the event of any issues whatsoever with these humidifiers for bedroom, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qwRRnH5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KONSIDEN","source_asin":"B0B8NRRMB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8NRRMB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8NRRMB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
