window.products.push({"id":1109285,"name":"Cyclysio 35 Inches Nightstand with Reversible Lift Top, Large Night Stand with LED Lights, Tall Bedside Table with Charging Station, High End Side Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CM3gFNlwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 1 pack 】 👍【Multi-function Lift Top Nightstand】: Cyclysio nightstand has a flexible lifting function with a reversible lift top, you can lift the top on the Left or Right side. The lift top is good and stable and doesn’t slam close. And the lifting top can be used to work, and entertainment, such as playing chess, video games, drinking, etc. when it comes down, it can be used as an invisible ample storage space. 🔋【Nightstand with Charging Station】: There are 3 plugs and 2 USB ports in our large end table, which is enough to charge multiple devices like your table lamp, phone, power bank, and computer simultaneously as a charging station, no more worries about the lack of ports anymore. ✅【Super Tall & Large Bedside Table】: As the height of this bedside table is about 35 Inches which is perfect for your California king-sized bed. When you lift up the lift plate, which is much higher than the bed, it is more suitable for adult height. Unlike the 21.7‘’ small tiny baby nightstand, our large night stand with 2 storage drawers will surely store more items and make it easier to reach for things. The size of the tall bed side table is 22\"L x 16\"W x 35\"H. 🌈【20 Colors of Dynamic LED Light】：The night stand is equipped with 20 colors of light strips, you can be manually controlled the color as you like by the remote controller (included) or your phone by Bluetooth. When you play music with the APP, the lights can also dance with the rhythm.You can create different atmospheres by adjusting the color, such as the happy and lively atmosphere at the party and the warm and romantic atmosphere before going to bed. 👌【Meet your Different Storage Needs】: This nightstand has 3-Tier storage space. The first tier is a hidden space under the lifting tabletop for storing private items. The second is a storage shelf, and the third is a drawer with a leather texture style. You can place your supplies such as books, glasses, snacks and table lamps according to your different storage requirements. 👩【Installation and After-Sales】: Our night stand comes with all accessories and detailed instructions which are divided into step-by-step tutorials (Kits and Tools Included). Just to follow it and complete the installation. If you have any questions about this lift top end table, please contact us, we will solve the problem for you in 24 Hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CM3gFNlwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cyclysio","source_asin":"B0C45T9THH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C45T9THH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C45T9THH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
