window.products.push({"id":1109370,"name":"36 Pcs Honey Dipper with 50 Pcs Wooden Bee, 3 inch Honeycomb, Mini Honey Comb, Honey Sticks, Mini Honey Jars Wooden Honey Mixing Stirrer Family Expens","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKqT5GRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your life sweetness! A honey dipper is one of those kitchen utensils that looks as though it’s come straight from a children’s picture book. But despite its novel appearance, the dipper is actually a very useful tool, best wood honey dippers. It allows you to drizzle honey over your food without getting your hands sticky. Of course, the wooden dipper is not just limited to honey. It can also be used to trickle other gloriously gooey things, such as syrups, caramels and jams. so you are able to select a honey dippers that best suits your kitchen. Here, we provide the Great Honey Dippers with wooden bees that are sure to bring a little sweetness to your life. How To Use A Honey Dipper: 1. Dip it! - dip the honey wand into your honey jar at an angle. 2. Cover it! - Cover the tip of the honey dipper in honey. 3. Twist it! - Slowly twist the handle of the dipper while lifting the tip out of the honey. 4. Dip it! -To release the honey simply stop twisting. Package List: 36 PCS Wooden Honey Dipper Sticks 50 PCS Self-Adhesive Wooden Bees Warm Tips: Hand wash is preferred and please keep the honey dipper dry after wash to avoid going mouldy. Efficient Customer Service We are committed to providing qualified items and we value our customers in a big way. We are ALWAYS here to assist if you've got any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zKqT5GRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CJFocus","source_asin":"B09ZV4GV6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZV4GV6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZV4GV6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
