window.products.push({"id":1109372,"name":"Vremi Mortar and Pestle Set - Ceramic Porcelain with Silicone Base and Grip - Dishwasher Safe Herb Spice Grinder Guacamole Salsa Maker - Apothecary Ph","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617SWqkwZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bewitch taste buds every time, with the Vremi Basic Witch’s Mortar & Pestle. The device that will take you back to the good olden times where it was used to crush and grind ingredients into a powder form. Made from sturdy apothecary grade ceramic means neither odors or flavors transfer from other foods, plus the food grade silicone on the base and handle make for a better grip during use. By hand-grinding ingredients, you release oils, flavors, and aromatics that electric spice grinder machine or food processors miss. Our mortar and pestle set work for all of your cooking ingredients, including salt, nuts, seeds, garlic, organic seasonings and more. Can also be used for crushing medications. It's not only highly functional, but it is also decorative. This multifunctional kitchen utensil is dishwasher safe (top rack recommended to preserve quality). Go ahead and add a dash of freshly ground magic to every dish: It’s easier than you think. Product Details & Care: Includes: 1 mortar and 1 pestle Includes: 1 mortar and 1 pestle Mortar Capacity: 7 ounce (198.45g) Mortar Capacity: 7 ounce (198.45g) Mortar Size: 4.5 x 3.25 inches Mortar Size: 4.5 x 3.25 inches Pestle Size: 5.5 x 1.75 inches Pestle Size: 5.5 x 1.75 inches Apothecary grade white ceramic porcelain body Apothecary grade white ceramic porcelain body Food-grade removable silicone base and handle Food-grade removable silicone base and handle Do not put in microwave, freezer, or above a direct heat source. Do not put in microwave, freezer, or above a direct heat source. Dishwasher safe (top rack recommended) Dishwasher safe (top rack recommended) For full care instructions and safety warnings, always refer to Vremi product box and manual For full care instructions and safety warnings, always refer to Vremi product box and manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617SWqkwZSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vremi","source_asin":"B01N41IHO3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N41IHO3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N41IHO3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
