window.products.push({"id":1109625,"name":"Skull Fuzzy Blanket，Soft Throw Blanket Lightweight Flannel Throw Blankets for Couch Bed Sofa Travelling Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ar4ioUPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Throw Blanket Is Used Widely In Everyday Life, A Desirable Blanket Would Perfect Your Whole Day Once You Cuddle Yourself In Softness And Warmth At The End Of A Day. It Comes In A Variety Of Colors And Designs, Making It One Of The More Decorative Blankets You Can Use In Home Decor. Depending Upon Size, They Can Decorate The Home By Being Artistically Draped Over Simple Chairs Or Tables, And Can Also Be A Excellent Gift Idea. One Can Also Find Throws Year Round With Varied Decorations. -- Versatile Throws: Ensure Ultimate Fluffy Softness With Our Flannel Fleece Blanket Throw All Year Round, Whether It’s In Summer Or Winter, Wait For Your Need At Anytime And Anywhere. Applicable To Various Occasions For Indoor Or Outdoor: Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Car, Rv, Camping, Travel, Decorative, Bedding, Home, Office, Picnic, Seaside,Cruise And More. --Perfect To Keep You Warm. Great Gift Idea For Your Friends Or Family. Perfect For Adults, Teens, Kids, Toddlers,Parents, And Grandparents. Keep Your Family Or Anyone You Love Warm All Year With The Soft Touch. Even Pets Love It! --They Also Can Provide Light Warmth For Any Member Of The Family. As Used In Living Rooms And Family Rooms, A Throw Blanket Is The Perfect Covering For An Afternoon Nap. Its Advantage Over A Regular Blanket Is That It Can Quickly Be Spread Out Again In Whatever Arrangement One Prefers After Serving Its Purpose Of Providing Warmth. --One Can Get Creative With These Blankets. They Make Excellent Wall Hangings, Or They Can Enliven The Dull Colors Of A Couch. One Can Also Use Them To Protect Couch Or Chair Cushions That Resist Cleaning. Note: Any Problems Can Feel Free To Contact Us, We Will Try Our Best To Solve It For You Within 24 Hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ar4ioUPbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jrotqux","source_asin":"B09KMVNQ8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KMVNQ8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KMVNQ8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
