window.products.push({"id":1109633,"name":"Space Heaters for Indoor 18'' Ceramic Tower Heater for Room with Thermostat,Fast Heating,3D Realistic Flame,Remote Control,Overheating&Tip-Over Protec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713YvPNu08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥Fast Heating & 2 Adjustable Modes: The advanced PTC ceraming heating technology combined with the ultra-efficient fan will heat up any space faster and distribute the heat more evenly. There are 2 modes for you to choose- low mode and high mode . Also equipped with a thermostat, you only need to set the desired temperature, so that you feel comfortable at all times. 🔥Dual Control Modes& 12H Timer: Keeping your room' temp. balancing over the night! This bedroom heater is equipped 0-12H timer, ensures you have a warm & comfortable night. Otherwise, this indoor use heater features dual control modes- button & remote control. You can control the space heater remotely on the sofa Or adjusting the temp by touching the button. 🔥Multiple protection: The space heater with auto shut off provides reliable tip-over and overheat protection. Safe for families with kids or pets who may knock it down. ABS flame-resistant material and a cool exterior for added safety. Also, this electric heater had passed the ETL certification, which fully ensures the safety of electricity and heating. 🔥Portable & Compact Heater: The small space heater is only 8.27 x 8.26 x 17.71 inches. Even in a small room, there is a place for it. The built-in handle makes it convenient for you to carry it to everywhere. It is suitable for indoor use, such as bedrooms, living rooms, apartments, offices, RVs and other areas that need to be heated etc. 🔥3D Flame Effect: This portable space heater designed in 3D flame effect which can provide a soft light and create an ideal sleep environment for your children in the frozen winter night. Not only provides constant warmth, but also permeates the Atmosphere of Christmas. 🔥Quiet Heating: Wide-angle oscillation improves the heating coverage rate and better distributes the heating evenly throughout the room. At the same time, the electric heater creates quiet heat with noise level as low as 45dB (quiet like a library). It will not disturb your work and sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713YvPNu08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSSIN","source_asin":"B09JP2RNV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JP2RNV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JP2RNV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
