window.products.push({"id":1109665,"name":"Just Artifacts Mercury Glass Votive Candle Holder 2.75-Inch Speckled Aqua Blue - Mercury Glass Votive Candle Holders for Weddings and Home Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e2rKOI7oL._AC_.jpg","description":"Just Artifacts Mercury Glass Votive Candle Holder 2.75\"H Speckled Aqua - Mercury Glass Votive Candle Holders for Weddings and Home Décor WEDDINGS, PARTIES & HOME DECOR: Mercury glass votive candle holders are the perfect touch to add glow and elegance to your event and/or home. Each votive is embellished with an antique finish. For safety precautions we recommend that you use a LED tealight candle with the votive; however, regular wax tealight candles can be used with the candle holders. DIMENSIONS: Approximately 2” diameter and 2.75” height TEALIGHT CANDLE IS NOT INCLUDED. SAFETY: For safety precautions we recommend the votives to be used with an LED tea light. However, regular tea light candles may be used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51e2rKOI7oL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Just Artifacts","source_asin":"B07PQNFKL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQNFKL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQNFKL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109666,"name":"Paula Deen 6.13 QT (1700 Watt) XL Air Fryer, Rapid Air Circulation System, Single Basket System, GranIT Ceramic Non-Stick Coating, Simple Knob Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zetM9-zZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for an air fryer to cook healthier, quick meals? If so, this new 6.13-quart XL air fryer from Paula Deen, is the perfect choice for you.  What makes this air fryer so special is the single basket design and rapid air circulation system, which allows for larger portions of food to be cooked at faster cooking times. Plus, its simple knob design makes it easy to use for family members of all ages. Simply place the food in the air fryer, set the timer and temperature dials, and that’s it! Paula has also added a handy cooking guide on top that shows the most common temperatures to choose from. Once the timer goes off, your food is ready and you will find it’s crispy, juicy, and a whole lot healthier than anything cooked in a deep fryer. That’s because, little to no oil is used, so there’s fewer calories. Finally, it won’t heat up your kitchen or leave a mess on your hands. In fact, our single basket is made with a ceramic non-stick coating, to make cleaning a breeze.  You’re sure to love using this air fryer and your family is going to love the food. And, as an added BONUS, Paula is including 11 of her favorite recipes to get you started, like Fried Mac and Cheese, Southern Fried Chicken, Bacon Wrapped Shrimp and more!  Get ready to prepare some of Paula Deen's best air fryer recipes, or just raid the freezer aisle for some of your family’s favorite guilty pleasures! Either way, Paula has created the perfect air fryer to prepare food on the lighter side—with less oil and less mess!  Love and best dishes, y’all!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zetM9-zZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paula Deen","source_asin":"B088TSDFXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TSDFXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TSDFXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
