window.products.push({"id":1109704,"name":"MOUISITON 12/24 Hours Magnetic Kitchen Timers with Digital Alarm Clock Timer, Big Screen Loud Alarm & Strong Magnet, Count-Up & Count Down for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hJhBX0H5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MOUISITON easily operated and multi-functional 12/24 hours digital alarm clock with kitchen timer The MOUISITON 24 hours digital kitchen timer is wildly application as a long time range count-up/ down timer, a digital clock and a alarm clock. And more, you will enjoy the cute design and flexible placements with its magnetic force, stand and clip back for cooking, resting, sporting, doing facial mask, studying or office timing. Specifications Time unit: hours, minutes, seconds Power: 1 x AAA battery (not included) Size: 3.34 x 2.83 x 0.8 inches Weight: 2.2 ounce Package: carton Package Contents: 1 x Kitchen timer 1 x Instruction manual Tips 1. Operate it under the conduction of its introduction. 2. It works with an AAA battery(not included). When the display is dim or alarm is not clear enough, please change the battery. 3. Press the button H, M or S over 2 seconds, it will adjust the time fast. 4. The magnet effect will be influenced by the flatness of the furniture surface, so you had better not make it adsorbed on the surface of the fridge all the time in case of falling down. 5. When you need adjust to the clock time, press \"mode\" button to the clock pattern first, then it could be adjustable. 6. Please keep the timer far away from the strong heat or the flame. Note: 1. Buy battery within the expiration date in proper shops to make sure that the battery is clean with no leakage and no corrosion. 2. Do not reverse the positive and negative terminals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hJhBX0H5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOUISITON","source_asin":"B08JYF48NN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYF48NN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYF48NN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109705,"name":"Calphalon Nylon Stir Fry Turner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21JGQjhkgkL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nylon Utensils Newly redesigned Calphalon Nylon Utensils feature a unique \"grip-anywhere handle\" that lets you decide where to hold it. Crafted with heat-resistant soft-touch silicone accents, these utensils give you a perfect balance of comfort and control. Innovative head designs make dozens of cooking tasks easier. Take a turn for the better. Calphalon turners are comfortable where they should be --in the handles. This stir fry turner scoops and turns food easily for great stir-fry results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21JGQjhkgkL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B000IVAJXE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IVAJXE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IVAJXE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109706,"name":"Digital Food Thermometer, Rapid Meat Thermometer, Direct Read With Probe For BBQ, Kitchen Cooking by SunrisePro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fPUb3ierL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cook To Perfection Every Time! There’s no good reason to ever over or undercook food again because you’re able to always get an accurate reading in as little as 4 seconds. It works great on any food you’re preparing and can be used to take temperatures of liquids like oil, milk or water, candy, pizza, steaks and even a whole animal if necessary! It’s perfect for preparing a Prime Rib that is just right or roasting a juicy turkey that isn’t too dry. Eliminate Guesswork and Never Spoil a Meal Again Our precise thermometer comes with an e-book reference food temperature guide, so you’re able to rival the skills of the best chefs today! You’ll love the convenience of having an e-book food temperature guide which you can print and be hung in a convenient spot for easy reference. When comparing our thermometer to competing products, be sure to recognize the convenience offered by the ultrathin 4.4-inch stainless-steel probe that folds and features a tapered end. Our ingenious design allows the probe to be folded in half for convenient storage when it isn’t being used. Easy to Use and Simple to Clean You’ll find that our thermometer is a joy to use. Once you have your reading, push the probe back in, which activates the convenient auto-off feature. To clean, just wipe the probe with a damp cloth! The battery is included in this must-have kitchen gadget and is available in striking red. It’s an awesome gift for any culinary genius in your life. Don’t wait another minute to start cooking all of your meals to perfection. Supplies are limited so the sooner you order, the faster you can start cooking succulent meals without the guesswork. Time Limited Exclusive Offer Buy this thermometer now!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fPUb3ierL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunrisePro","source_asin":"B0183QYH42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0183QYH42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0183QYH42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
