window.products.push({"id":1109756,"name":"KavRave Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin,Silver Grey Silk Pillowcase King,Both Sided 100% Mulberry Silk Pillowcase 20x36 Inches,Real Silk Bed Pillow ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w0bbplDjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE SILK PILLOWCASE? Silk is acknowledged to be one of the most suitable fabrics for bedding in the world. When you have spent a tired day, there is no better feeling than sleeping on soft, smooth silk. Relax in the hassle-free sleep offered by our classic silk pillow cases that feel great to touch and improves your mood every time you wake up. Mulberry silk pillow cases is soothing, delicate and super soft. Sleeping on silk, it can reduce the friction between facial skin and pillowcase, which helps reduce facial wrinkles and benefits skin moisturizing. Pure mulberry silk is a natural temperature regulator which is skin-friendly and moisture to help feel cool in summer and warm in winter. SILK CARE INSTRUCTION How to wash silk in a washing machine Choose a low heat setting (30 Degree C) and a gentle wash cycle.Only wash silk items with similar color to help avoid colour run.Use a mild detergent designed for delicate fabrics.Place extra delicate items inside a laundry bag or pillow case to protect them whilst in the washing drum How to wash silk by hand To begin with, fill a bowl with cold water. Add a little detergent and then put your silk items inside the bowl.Move the clothes around the bowl gently to help the cleaning process .Once cleaned, remove your items from the bucket and empty the water. Rinse each piece of clothing separately in cold water until all detergent residue is removed.   How to dry silk safely ··Never wring your silk garments as this can leave lasting creases and risks breaking the fibres · Hang the items away from direct sunlight or heat   ABOUT THE SILK VERIFICATION True-Real silk has high flame retardancy and you can't see the open flame.It have the smells like burning hair and is difficult to continue burning and will automatically extinguish. False-When the fake silk meet the fire will burning rapidly, with a plastic taste, burning faster.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51w0bbplDjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KavRave","source_asin":"B094NQ953N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094NQ953N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094NQ953N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
