window.products.push({"id":1109860,"name":"Farmers Harvest Basket - 9.8\" x 15.7\" Large Woven Basket in Reddish Brown - Wearable Woven Storage Basket - Vegetable Fruit Basket with Lid - Cute Pic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611zKvhjpsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HARVEST YOUR PRODUCE IN STYLE: Forget the traditional rattan basket that can be too heavy to carry by hand or the plastic harvest basket with a smaller capacity, because this chic boho basket will make you want to go out and harvest your fruits, crops or veggies more regularly. With adjustable straps, this woven basket with lid provides a stylish yet convenient way to bring out the farmer in you FRUIT & VEGETABLE STORAGE and BOHO DECOR IN ONE: When it's not yet time for harvest, this lovely rustic basket can very well be a beautiful storage tote for fruits, veggies, or even other items in your kitchen. You may even use the shoulder straps to hang them and use them as beautiful wall decor just like a decorative basket that holds preserved flowers that could add more beauty to any space UNIQUELY ARTISAN-MADE WOVEN BASKETS: When it comes to reliability, function & durability, this harvest garden basket beats all the others as the small or large woven basket is made by skilled craftsmen, using only top-quality natural materials. So whether you're using it as a fruit picker basket, berry basket, flower basket, or garden bag, you never have to worry about these woven baskets going in vain FUNCTIONAL & DECORATIVE BASKETS AS THE PERFECT GIFT IDEA: With its design and function, there's no doubt that our lovely wearable weave basket makes for the perfect gift for any occasion. Anyone who's fond of boho & rustic decor, gardening, farming, picnics, and the like, would truly love to receive boho baskets like this CUTE HARVEST BASKETS SPECIALLY DESIGNED FOR YOUR HOME: Here at Primo Supply, it is our mission to make house keeping a tad bit easier. We make sure that all our problem-solving products are durable & reliable. That said, if there is anything about these artisan rattan baskets that's not at par with your expectations, please reach out to us so we can make things better. These woven baskets are specially made for your happiness","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611zKvhjpsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primo Supply","source_asin":"B08W2LW841","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W2LW841","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W2LW841","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
