window.products.push({"id":1109873,"name":"AMERLIFE Twin XL Bed Frame/Platform Bed with Upholstered Headboard & Upgraded Steel Slats - Heavy Duty Metal Mattress Foundation/No Box Spring Needed/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vNUt8m8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amerlife is committed to providing customers with affordable but competitive in quality products.Selling Features:【Easy Assemble】- The metal bed frame comes in a single box containing all the components and instruction manual.You can assemble the metal bed frame within 30 min.【Sturdy Frame】- Platform bed holds onto overall weight with ease because of its patented construction from sturdy iron; sturdy and also possess an extended lifespan.【Modern Look】- Headboard of platform bed wrapped in exquisite upholstery; its simple, clean, and modern design is suitable for all decor style of bedroom.【Storage Space】- The upholstered platform bed stands at 12” tall from the floor, providing enough space beneath the frame.As a center point of bedroom, Amerlife bed frame with headboard always has a significant impact on comfort and aesthetics. Product DetailsProduct dimensions -83\" L x 62\" W x 35.4\" H(QUEEN); 77.5\" L x 56\" W x 35.4\" H(FULL); 83\" L x 41\" W x 35.4\" H(TWIN) Weight: 55 pounds(QUEEN); 51 pounds(FULL); 37 pounds(TWIN)Weight limit -1000lbs.Color: Light GreyUnder bed clearance -12\" Headboard Height - 16.5''Legs height -12\"  Service:Amerlife Metal Platform Bed Frame is accompanied by a warranty of two years and a satisfaction return guarantee of 30-days. Any questions please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vNUt8m8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMERLIFE","source_asin":"B08SM8TZ77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SM8TZ77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SM8TZ77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109874,"name":"100 Books Scratch-Off Poster - Millennials Edition Essential Novels,18 x 24 Living Room Wall Art Decor, Great Gift for Book Lovers or to Impress Your ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pzsh6dXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quality-made with Vintage Design Do you love to read or have you set a goal to read morethis year? Either way, this scratch-off poster of 100 Books, Millennial Edition,is what you need! Printed on quality poster paper, each title is covered in alovely metallic gold coating – as you read one of the books, you scratch offthe foil to reveal a vintage-style graphic cover– and announce to the worldthat you’ve read it. Promotes Reading and a Healthy Lifestyle It’s a lot of fun and really motivates you to read– it’s yourliterary to-do list! Making time to read exercises your mind, reduces stress,and improves your mood. Not only that, this poster introduces you to some of thebest literature of modern times and takes all the guesswork out of what to read– you can pick any title and know you’re sampling some of the best authors andbooks of this century. Beautiful Home Décor Let’s not forget that it’s beautiful. Scratched off or not,it’s a stunning piece of art work. It’s a large print – 18 inches wide by 24inches high, so you can feature it as wall décor in any room, from a small nookin your office to front-and-center on your living room wall, surrounded by otherart pieces. Excellent Gift for So Many People! This poster is also a very much appreciated gift. Graduatesfrom college or high school, teachers, your favorite librarian, the members ofyour book club, coworkers who love to read, your spouse, as a Mother’s Day or Father’sDay present… it’s that perfect kind of gift that’s affordable enough to buy inmultiples but thoughtful enough to be remembered. If you really want to WOWsomeone you love, create a reading kit with the poster, book collections, and readingaccessories. They’ll go absolutely crazy for it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pzsh6dXWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAMEHOM","source_asin":"B075YB16RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075YB16RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075YB16RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
