window.products.push({"id":1109966,"name":"MarinaPolly 12 x 16 Metal Sign - Edsel Parking ONLY - Vintage Look","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VF2lYjMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 12-inch by 16-inch (12\" x 16\") metal sign gives the effect of aging with simulated rusted edges and scratched and faded paint. It has smooth rounded corners and includes pre-drilled mounting holes. Suitable for indoor or outdoor use, this sign is weatherproof and won't fade in the sun for many years. Our individually handcrafted signs are perfect for kitchens, bathrooms, doors, garages, man caves, cubicle walls -- any place you'd like smaller, very unique signs. Note: While these signs may appear to have raised letters, textured rust or embossing, they are actually perfectly flat. These are images that are baked onto a metal sign. The texturing or embossing may look real, but these signs are completely flat and not textured.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VF2lYjMgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J.DXHY","source_asin":"B07NV4ZY6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NV4ZY6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NV4ZY6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1109967,"name":"MCEAST 4 Pack Merry Christmas Kitchen Towels Oversized Snowflake Christmas Dish Towels Absorbent Christmas Decorative Drying Dish Cloths for Cooking B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyM2x2UhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish design: our Christmas holiday dish towels set comes in 4 different styles and each style is designed with pretty snowflake patterns, easily adding a strong festival atmosphere to your Christmas. Package and size: each set includes 4 packs of snowflake Christmas dish towels, which are sufficient in quantity and fashionable, must-have household items for home life. Each Christmas kitchen towel measures 18 x 28 inches/45 x 71 cm, large enough to meet your cleaning needs. Premium material: each of our winter holiday Christmas towel is made of microfiber and the surface adopts brushed fabric, making our dish towels super absorbent, durable, have no pungent smell, soft, extremely breathable and with a high stain removal capacity, ideal for drying dishes and water stains on the table. Range of use: you can use these absorbent merry Christmas towels to dry your hands, dishes, or utensils, which can quickly absorb the dirt and clean your countertops, tables, windows and other items. You can also hang them on the handle of the oven, the top of the countertop, or on the towel rack to decorate your home and kitchen. Ideal Christmas decoration: our Christmas holiday dish towels are ideal kitchen decorative supplies for Christmas family gatherings, birthday parties or other occasions in winter. What's more, they are also foolproof gifts for your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyM2x2UhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MCEAST","source_asin":"B0B87476DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87476DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87476DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
