window.products.push({"id":1109991,"name":"Espresso Coffee Maker Pot Stovetop Moka Coffee Pot Stainless Steel Latte Cappuccino Percolator with Bonus Scoop for Home Hotel Office Gift, 2 Cups/100","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DslyDtJDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A Kitchen Essential For Coffee Enthusiasts and Lovers!Waking Up With The Smell of Fresh Coffee In The Morning! CHANMOL's Coffee Maker is the perfect tool to save your significant time and effort - less work, perfect full flavoured coffee in minutes! The Advantages of our product: 1.BEAUTIFUL, UNIQUE, AND FUNCTIONAL - Elegant Appearance.Classic Italian method of brewing espresso. Practical and produces a full-bodied cup of espresso in under 5 minutes! 2.SAFETY FOOD GRADE STAINLESS STEEL - BPA FREE,Eco-friendly.Solid, durable and lasts for years. 3.SIMPLE OPERATION - Three compartments fit together easily by screwing,just simply add water,add coffee,apply to the stove and you have coffee in minutes. 4.DISHWASHER FRIENDLY - Easy to clean store and safe to put in the dishwasher. 6.MAKES A PERFECT GIFT FOR ANYONE - Great Mother’s and Father’s Day gifts.Best birthday gift for your friends who loves coffee. Specification:Material: Stainless Steel, SiliconeCapacity: 2 cup (100ml /3.4Oz) Using: 1.Fill the lower chamber with water, place the filter in, then fill with medium ground coffee.Do not press the coffee down too firmly. 2.Screw the two sections together making sure the filter and rubber gasket are in place, this ensures a perfect seal and it is very important! 3.Place the pot onto your cooking appliance and heat. 4.When the coffee has ceased flowing the percolator should be removed from the heat. Serve. PACKAGE INCLUDED:1* 2 Cup/100ml Coffee Maker Pot1* ScoopGreat Value for Coffee Enthusiasts and Lovers! - Enjoy the classic Italian brewing espresso everyday!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DslyDtJDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beminh","source_asin":"B07CL7NQSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1109991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CL7NQSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CL7NQSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
